RESOURCES — literature for the paper
====================================

Contents:

  additional.bib   Bibliography for the project. This is a symlink to
                   ../DOC/paper.bib (the canonical file — JOSS's build bot
                   requires a real paper.bib in DOC, so the canonical copy
                   lives there and this points at it).
  notes            Few-sentence summaries of each cited work and why it
                   matters to this project. Not a collation of abstracts.
  <key>.pdf        The PDF of each cited work, named by its bib key
                   (e.g. patnaik2021but.pdf).  TODO: add these.

No Makefile here: nothing is generated.
